'''Araxá''' ({{Langx|tpn|ara-cha}}; {{Literal translation|high ground}}) is a city on the island of [[Pindorama]], an [[Indigenous nations in Balisca|Indigenous nation]] and [[communities of Balisca|community]] within [[Balisca]]. It is one of the fastest-growing cities in Balisca, mostly as a result of immigration from [[W:South America|South America]] and [[W:West Africa|West Africa]].  

